\def\@LN@column{1}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Feature-level comparison of Tri-Modal-ECG and the MEETI release \cite  {zhang2024meeti}. ``yes/no'' is decided from the released artefact: cells in the MEETI column reflect what is shipped in the MEETI repository (signals, $\sim $10{,}000 plotted images, beat-level features extracted by FeatureDB, MIMIC-IV report, GPT-4o interpretations); cells in our column reflect what is shipped in this release. Tri-Modal-ECG matches MEETI on the four core modalities and additionally provides full-coverage clean and scan-like images, a multi-stage persisted QC, patient-level splits with leakage checks, three deterministic benchmark tasks, and per-modality storage budgets.}}{3}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
