\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Tri-Modal-ECG construction pipeline (10 stages). Blue boxes are indexing stages (master index from \texttt  {record\_list.csv} and \texttt  {machine\_measurements.csv}, patient-level split, leakage check). Green boxes are signal/image generation (WFDB \cite  {xiao2018physionet} extraction to NumPy \cite  {harris2020array}, Matplotlib \cite  {hunter2007matplotlib} clean rendering, OpenCV \cite  {bradski2000opencv} deterministic scan-like augmentation). Orange boxes are quality control (image integrity check using PIL+OpenCV decoders, per-study QC JSON, cleaned-index gating). Red box is the three benchmark tasks (verification / temporal grounding / plausibility) emitted as JSONL streams. Every stage is independently re-runnable from its on-disk inputs.}}{4}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline_paper}{{2}{4}{Tri-Modal-ECG construction pipeline (10 stages). Blue boxes are indexing stages (master index from \texttt {record\_list.csv} and \texttt {machine\_measurements.csv}, patient-level split, leakage check). Green boxes are signal/image generation (WFDB \cite {xiao2018physionet} extraction to NumPy \cite {harris2020array}, Matplotlib \cite {hunter2007matplotlib} clean rendering, OpenCV \cite {bradski2000opencv} deterministic scan-like augmentation). Orange boxes are quality control (image integrity check using PIL+OpenCV decoders, per-study QC JSON, cleaned-index gating). Red box is the three benchmark tasks (verification / temporal grounding / plausibility) emitted as JSONL streams. Every stage is independently re-runnable from its on-disk inputs}{figure.caption.4}{}}
